    [CI] Bump CANN to 9.2.0_20261022115200 (#19449)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Updates the CANN base image pin from `9.2.0_20261016144033` to
    `9.2.0_20261022115200` across all eight root Dockerfiles, covering A2,
    A3, 310P, and A5 on Ubuntu and openEuler.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    Yes. Images built from the root Dockerfiles use CANN
    `9.2.0_20261022115200`.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    - `git diff --check`
    - Verified all eight root Dockerfiles contain the new version and none
    retain the previous version.
    - Full image builds are left to CI because they require the project SWR
    credentials and architecture-specific runners.
    
    ---
    
    ### Checklist
    
